{"id":"5a572a3bc5b2eba8","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-semigroup.md","title":"Semigroup","display":"df-semigroup — Semigroup","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-semigroup","aliases":["58-df-semigroup","Semigroup"],"display":"df-semigroup — Semigroup","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-semigroup"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-semigroup</span><span>Semigroup</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-semigroup — Semigroup"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\cdot\\in V\">\\(S,\\cdot\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)\\)</span> (binary-operation graph, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Semigroup}(S,\\cdot)\">\\(\\operatorname{Semigroup}(S,\\cdot)\\)</span> (semigroup predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash \\operatorname{Semigroup}(S,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow S\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\\cdot(\\langle\\cdot(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)=\\cdot(\\langle x,\\cdot(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash \\operatorname{Semigroup}(S,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow S\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\\cdot(\\langle\\cdot(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)=\\cdot(\\langle x,\\cdot(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A semigroup consists of a nonempty set equipped with an associative closed binary operation; the nonemptiness guard prevents the empty function from satisfying the definition vacuously.</li>\n<li>Inverse semigroup: every element has partial inverse; used in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C^*\">\\(C^*\\)</span>-algebras</li>\n<li>Operator semigroups: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(t+s) = T(t)T(s)\">\\(T(t+s) = T(t)T(s)\\)</span>; strongly continuous <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_0\">\\(C_0\\)</span>-semigroups</li>\n<li>Topological semigroup: continuity of multiplication; compact semigroups studied by Hofmann</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Clifford and Preston, The Algebraic Theory of Semigroups</li>\n<li>Ljapin and Evseyev, Semigroup Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S,\\cdot\\in V$ with $\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)$ (binary-operation graph, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,\\cdot\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Semigroup}(S,\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}semigroup}\\vdash \\operatorname{Semigroup}(S,\\cdot)\\leftrightarrow S\\neq\\varnothing\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\cdot,S\\times S,S)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in S\\;\\Bigl(\\cdot(\\langle\\cdot(\\langle x,y\\rangle),z\\rangle)=\\cdot(\\langle x,\\cdot(\\langle y,z\\rangle)\\rangle)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"C^*","display":false},{"tex":"T(t+s) = T(t)T(s)","display":false},{"tex":"C_0","display":false}],"bytes":1303,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1132","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-semigroup.md|58-df-semigroup]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}